OL,3,GNEWSAThe hospice staff helping children
OL,4,Acope with loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine-year-old Holly's world was turned
OL,7,Fupside down when her mum Jenny died two
OL,8,Fyears ago this month.
OL,10,FShe "couldn't sleep on her own, was
OL,11,Fhaving nightmares, couldn't even
OL,12,Fmention her mum's name", according to
OL,13,Fdad, Andy.
OL,15,FBut with the support of St Richard's
OL,16,FHospice, in Worcester, which has
OL,17,Fincluded counselling and activity days,
OL,18,Fthe nine-year-old is "happy to talk
OL,19,Fabout her mum, is outgoing and bubbly".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
