OL,3,GNEWSAThe hospice staff helping children
OL,4,Acope with loss
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity provides specialist support
OL,7,Fto about 200 children and young people
OL,8,Feach year, which is partly funded by
OL,9,FBBC Children in Need.
